fixture radiance_bursts_with_a_dash_on_its_burst_frame
doc docs/adr/0013, Radiance (task 6 review, H3): a dash pressed during the startup comes out on the burst frame, and the burst comes too. An action on that frame used to end the spell before it burst: 66 Flame for nothing.
room test/dummy
option flame 66
option kindling 20
frames 20
input
  0 D spell
  3 dash
end
expect
  at 0 spell=radiance flame=0
  at 6 event.dash=1 event.radiance=1
end
